    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSnipe Lodge is a beautifully presented 4-bedroom detached residence set on approximately 15 acres in a peaceful rural setting, offering an exceptional blend of country living, equestrian facilities, and future potential. Maintained in excellent condition throughout, the home benefits from a range of energy efficiency upgrades including an upgraded boiler, new front and rear doors, cavity wall insulation, attic insulation, and solar panels.\n\nThe accommodation is bright, spacious, and thoughtfully designed for modern family living. The current owners have cleverly maximised the first-floor space with built-in storage and wardrobes within the eaves, while the bathrooms and en suites have all been recently upgraded to a high standard.\n\nApproached through electric gates that lead to a sweeping driveway that wraps around the house, the property offers ample parking and privacy. A separate roadway leads directly to the horse stables and arena, making it ideally suited for equestrian use. The horse yard is fully serviced with power and water connections.\n\nThe lands, typical of the area, offers significant scope for improvement, rewilding, hobby farming, or further equestrian development. \n\nSnipe Lodge presents a rare opportunity to acquire a substantial family home with extensive lands and endless potential in a tranquil countryside setting.\n\nGarden;\nDual entrance driveway that wraps around the house, providing ample parking and easy access. The property features a large front lawn with mature trees and planting, while the gently sloped rear garden includes raised beds and mature shrubbery. Extending to approximately 15 acres, the lands offer excellent potential for a variety of uses including rewilding, hobby farming, or equestrian use."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall: - \nComposite front door, Vinyl Herringbone floor, under stairs storage, large wide and bright.\n\nSitting Room: - \nLaminate timber floor, built in alcove units, multi fuel stove, dual front aspect windows.\n\nLiving Room: - \nLaminate timber floor, built in library style book shelving, front aspect window.\n\nStudy / Home Office: - \nLaminate timber floor, side aspect window.\n\nKitchen Dining Room: - \nVinyl Herringbone floor, wall and floor kitchen units, built in dishawasher, pantry, ample storage, dual rear aspect window.\n\nSun Room: - \nVinyl Herringbone floor, panoramic aspect, slide doors access rear garden.\n\nUtility Room: - \nVinyl Herringbone floor, built in cabinets, plumbed for washing machine & dryer, wash hand basin, rear aspect window, access to rear garden.\n\nWC: - \nVinyl Herringbone floor, wc, shelving, rear aspect window.\n\nBedroom 1: - \nCarpet on floor, built in eave storage, rear aspect window.\n\nEn Suite: - \nFully tiled, wc, wash hand basin with vanity, Mira electric shower, rear aspect window.\n\nBedroom 2: - \nCarpet on floor, built in wardrobe, built in eaves storage, rear aspect window.\n\nEn Suite: - \nFully tiled, wc, wahs hand basin with vanity, Mira electric shower, rear aspect window.\n\nBedroom 3: - \nCarpet on floor, built in eave storage, front aspect window.\n\nBedroom 4: - \nCarpet on floor, built in wardrobe, built in eave storage, front aspect window.\n\nBathroom: - \nFully tiled, wc, wash hand basin with vanity, freestanding bath, shower mixer tap, shower mizer tap, front aspect window.\n\nHot Press: - \nShelved, hot water tank.\n\n"
      },
      {
